<title>USA: Radica names new president/COO.</title>
<headline>Radica names new president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radica Games Ltd said Tuesday it has named Pat Feely president and chief operating officer of the company and president of Radica USA, beginning July 1.</p>
<p>Feely succeeds Bob Davids, who has been named chief executive of the toy company.</p>
<p>Feely has been a director of the company since July 1996 and is the former president of Fun Source, a unit of Strottman International Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
